        "**LangGraph** treats an agent as an explicit graph of steps with shared state. Its own docs describe it as a low-level orchestration runtime focused on durable execution, streaming, human-in-the-loop and persistence ([LangGraph docs](https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/langgraph/overview)). Pick it when you need precise control, checkpoints and human approval.",
